<title>CANADA: Trimac Ltd Q4 shr net falls.</title>
<headline>Trimac Ltd Q4 shr net falls.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			    1995</p>
<p> Shr			 C$0.31		   C$0.40</p>
<p> Net			 12,753		   16,258</p>
